# Keep the Docker build context to SOURCE only.
#
# `csi-deploy/firmware/Dockerfile` consumes this checkout as a named build context (`fwsrc` /
# `esprs`). BuildKit has no way to filter a named context from the consuming Dockerfile, so the
# filter has to live here — and without it the context is `target/`: 4.8 GB and 7.6 GB of build
# artefacts respectively, against ~15 MB and ~1 MB of actual source. The container builds into its
# own cache-mounted target dir, so nothing here is wanted anyway.
#
# Mirrors .gitignore. Same reason, different tool.
target/
